# Dependency scripts are blocked in CI via the --ignore-scripts flag in workflows.
# The preinstall guard in package.json blocks "npm install" locally and forces
# "npm ci" (reproducible, lockfile-pinned installs).
# Do NOT add ignore-scripts=true here — it would disable the preinstall guard.
# (engine-strict omitted: a transitive jsdom dep wants a newer Node patch than
#  some dev machines have; CI runs Node 24.)
